hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"251","On the authority of Imran bin Musa Al-Qazzaz, on the authority of Abdul-Warith, meaning Ibn Sa’id, on the authority of Yazid, which is Rashak, on the authority of Mu’adh, which is Al-Adawiya, she said: I asked Aisha: Can a woman perform ritual ablution with her husband after impurity from the same vessel all together? She said: “Water is pure and nothing is harmful to water. The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, and I used to wash in the same vessel.” She said: I started it and poured it on his hands before he dipped them in the water.”"
